{"reviews":[{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-0","r":5.0,"t":"Everything was perfect","x":"Came exactly when it said it would and it was perfect like ok the picture.","h":40,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-1","r":5.0,"t":"Extremely versatile for any hairstyle!!!","x":"So, let\u2019s discuss this awesome mannequin. Great way to practice hairstyles, especially braiding techniques for my personal preference. I purchased the one with \u201914in of hair, which is the perfect length for any hairstyle and you can even practice box braids or any form of hairstyles which incorporates braiding hair. I practiced two French braids on mine bc I am working on perfecting French braids and it I am very happy with my outcome and I didn\u2019t need to add any product to the air, but that\u2019s a","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-2","r":4.0,"t":"Great","x":"Bought this for my daughter ages 12 and 5. They are very serious about doing hair and they love it","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-3","r":5.0,"t":"Wig Line","x":"It came in fast...It was wrapped nicely and its full and good quality of hair for me to use so I can teach myself how to do different braiding techniques for my wig line.  I seen another person with this same mannequin head and she informed me of the information. Im glad I ordered this mannequin head. Worth it for the price!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-4","r":5.0,"t":"Decent purchase","x":"Quick shipping. I have a thick table and clamp is too small to fit. I\u2019ll need to buy a stand. Hair is good easy to braid. Not as thick as Afro but thicker than European. Shedding but after wash it was minimized.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-5","r":5.0,"t":"It sheds a lot in the beginning but maintains thickness","x":"I absolutely love this manikin head hair. It\u2019s great practice for me on my braiding skills, although it sheds a lot in the beginning but due to the thickness the hair doesn\u2019t thin out. I highly recommend","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-6","r":5.0,"t":"Best Gift Ever!","x":"Bought it as a gift for my Granddaughter (8yrs old) for Christmas. She has played with it every day since she got it. She LOVES it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great for learning and styling!","x":"Holds shape nice and doesn\u2019t get tangled easily, if your looking for something to help you learn, this is the way to go.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-8","r":5.0,"t":"Will buy again to teach my kids to braid","x":"I like the density of the mannequin. It\u2019s perfect to learning how to do new hairstyles. The hair feels amazing!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-9","r":5.0,"t":"Everything about it is natural\u2763\ufe0f","x":"I love this Mannequin head (Sasha\u263a\ufe0f) At one point I forgot it was a Mannequin because of how versatile it was.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-10","r":5.0,"t":"Great for photography work","x":"Great for what I have needed to do, I am a portrait photographer and its great for practicing head shots","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-11","r":5.0,"t":"Love it","x":"I absolutely love it! The hair is super soft and manageable!! I can\u2019t wait to do more styles on it","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-12","r":5.0,"t":"Vey soft hair","x":"Hair is very soft feels real and worth the money for practicing styles. My daughter loves it!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-13","r":2.0,"t":"It\u2019s decent","x":"It\u2019s ok , but it sheds wayyyyyyy too much ! It kinda makes a mess , but it\u2019s pretty decent","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-14","r":5.0,"t":"Good Choice","x":"I love the thickness of the hair. A little shedding but love the texture of the hair.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great deal","x":"My daughter loved it.Receive the product on time and it was just what we thought.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-16","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful hair","x":"I love it, the hair is so pretty and very helpfully for doing hairstyles.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-17","r":5.0,"t":"Great for braiding!","x":"Comes with a perfect stand and makes a fun gift for kids actually.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-18","r":5.0,"t":"Buy now!","x":"Feels like real hair and has helped me do my daughters hair better","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-19","r":5.0,"t":"Hair Texture","x":"This mannequin head is so REAL looking and the hair is so soft.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-20","r":4.0,"t":"Satisfied","x":"Bought this for my daughter on Christmas she is very satisfied","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-21","r":3.0,"t":"My daughter loves it but it sheds","x":"It sheds ALOT.. So make sure you have a broom handy","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-22","r":5.0,"t":"Just as described!","x":"My sister is very happy with this purchase!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-23","r":1.0,"t":"Not human hair","x":"Maybe I misread but this is not human hair","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B09CYPJHZ5-24","r":3.0,"t":"As advertised","x":"I like it but it sheds a lot of hair. :-(","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the hair as soft, natural-feeling, and good quality for practicing styles.","cites":[4,9,10,12,13]},{"text":"Many customers say it is great for learning and practicing braiding and other hairstyles.","cites":[2,4,6,8,9]},{"text":"Several reviewers mention the hair sheds, though some note it is mainly at the beginning or offset by thickness.","cites":[5,6,14,15]},{"text":"Some customers highlight fast shipping and nice packaging.","cites":[1,4,5]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention buying it as a gift for children who love it.","cites":[3,7,13]}]},"qa":[]}